# ============================================================================
# .claude repository — STRICT WHITELIST .gitignore
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is rooted at ~/.claude, a directory full of runtime data, caches,
# and SECRETS. To avoid ever leaking credentials or private conversation logs
# to the GitHub remote (origin = github.com/patapu/agents), we IGNORE
# EVERYTHING at the repo root by default and re-include ONLY the few
# directories that are meant to be version-controlled.
#
# To track a new top-level item, add an explicit "!/<name>" line below.
# ============================================================================

# 1) Ignore everything at the repo root by default.
/*

# 2) Re-include ONLY the intended tracked content.
!/.gitignore
!/agents/
!/skills/
!/docs/

# 3) Belt-and-suspenders: hard deny for known secrets / private runtime data.
#    These come after the whitelist so they always win, in case a future
#    "!/..." rule is ever added that would otherwise expose them.
/.credentials.json
/history.jsonl
/mcp-needs-auth-cache.json
/scheduled_tasks.lock
/.last-cleanup
/settings.json
/settings.local.json
/yolo-log.ps1
/.context/
/.claude/
/projects/
/sessions/
/session-env/
/shell-snapshots/
/telemetry/
/paste-cache/
/file-history/
/cache/
/downloads/
/backups/
/drafts/
/ide/
/plugins/
/research/
/tasks/

# Note: CLAUDE.md and META_PIPELINE.md are intentionally NOT tracked by
# default (CLAUDE.md holds private global instructions). Add "!/CLAUDE.md"
# or "!/META_PIPELINE.md" above if you decide to version them.
